    "user_request_original": "Optimize a 24-layer alternating HfO2/SiO2 stack on fused silica substrate for dual-band performance. Incidence: air, normal angle, unpolarized. Materials: HfO2 (high-index), SiO2 (low-index). Layer sequence: HfO2/SiO2 alternating, starting with HfO2. Thickness bounds: layers 1-3: 40-60 nm, layers 5-8: 100-140 nm, layers 4 and 9-24: 30-200 nm. Initialize with perturbed seeds in specified ranges. Objectives: maximize mean transmittance 800-1500 nm, maximize mean reflectance 200-400 nm. Optimizer: gradient_thickness with step size reduced 20% from baseline. Robustness: ±15 nm absolute normal deviation. Total layer count fixed at 24. Canonical user controls: wavelength intervals 200-400 nm, 800-1500 nm. soft objectives: High transmission in 800-1500 nm band; High reflection in 200-400 nm band. behaviors to suppress or avoid: Low transmission in 200-400 nm band; Low reflection in 800-1500 nm band. manufacturing constraints: Total layers <= 30; Materials limited to HfO2 and SiO2.",
